        <owl:annotatedTarget>A type of evidence in which information is recorded in some documentation system, for example, but not limited to a publication, survey, or medical record.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ECO:SN</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
